Someone posted (not sure who) a little earlier about a bug that would let
you move more people than you have on a sector.  The fix for this is very
simple...

Line 1341 of command.c presently reads:
		errormsg("Sorry, not that many people live there.");

Just add another line after that so that the file reads:
		errormsg("Sorry, not that many people live there.");
		return;

A quick and fully operational fix!

